   {
    "id": "p_00004",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     17,
     1
    ],
    "text": "[CODE3]",
    "placeholders": {
     "CODE3": {
      "open": "",
      "close": "",
      "translate": false,
      "raw": "<code><tt>#include &lt;<a href=\"../basedefs/sys_stat.h.html\">sys/stat.h</a>&gt;<br>\n<br>\nint fstat(int</tt> <i>fildes</i><tt>, struct stat *</tt><i>buf</i><tt>);<br></tt></code>"
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "h4_00005",
    "type": "h4",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     19
    ],
    "text": "[A4][/A4]DESCRIPTION",
    "placeholders": {
     "A4": {
      "open": "<a name=\"tag_17_189_03\" id=\"tag_17_189_03\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00006",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     21,
     1
    ],
    "text": "The [I5]fstat[/I5]() function shall obtain information about an open file associated with the file descriptor [I6]fildes[/I6], and\nshall write it to the area pointed to by [I7]buf[/I7].",
    "placeholders": {
     "I5": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I6": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I7": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00007",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     21,
     3
    ],
    "text": "[S8][[A9]SHM[/A9]][/S8] [IMG10]\nIf [I11]fildes[/I11] references a shared memory object, the implementation shall update in the [B12]stat[/B12] structure pointed to by the\n[I13]buf[/I13] argument the [I14]st_uid[/I14], [I15]st_gid[/I15], [I16]st_size[/I16], and [I17]st_mode[/I17] fields, and only the S_IRUSR, S_IWUSR,\nS_IRGRP, S_IWGRP, S_IROTH, and S_IWOTH file permission bits need be valid. The implementation may update other fields and flags.\n[IMG18]",
    "placeholders": {
     "S8": {
      "open": "<sup>",
      "close": "</sup>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "A9": {
      "open": "<a href=\"javascript:open_code(&#x27;SHM&#x27;)\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "IMG10": {
      "open": "",
      "close": "",
      "translate": false,
      "raw": "<img src=\"../images/opt-start.gif\" alt=\"[Option Start]\" border=\"0\">"
     },
     "I11": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "B12": {
      "open": "<b>",
      "close": "</b>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I13": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I14": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I15": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I16": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I17": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "IMG18": {
      "open": "",
      "close": "",
      "translate": false,
      "raw": "<img src=\"../images/opt-end.gif\" alt=\"[Option End]\" border=\"0\">"
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00008",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     21,
     5
    ],
    "text": "[S19][[A20]TYM[/A20]][/S19] [IMG21]\nIf [I22]fildes[/I22] references a typed memory object, the implementation shall update in the [B23]stat[/B23] structure pointed to by the\n[I24]buf[/I24] argument the [I25]st_uid[/I25], [I26]st_gid[/I26], [I27]st_size[/I27], and [I28]st_mode[/I28] fields, and only the S_IRUSR, S_IWUSR,\nS_IRGRP, S_IWGRP, S_IROTH, and S_IWOTH file permission bits need be valid. The implementation may update other fields and flags.\n[IMG29]",
    "placeholders": {
     "S19": {
      "open": "<sup>",
      "close": "</sup>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "A20": {
      "open": "<a href=\"javascript:open_code(&#x27;TYM&#x27;)\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "IMG21": {
      "open": "",
      "close": "",
      "translate": false,
      "raw": "<img src=\"../images/opt-start.gif\" alt=\"[Option Start]\" border=\"0\">"
     },
     "I22": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "B23": {
      "open": "<b>",
      "close": "</b>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I24": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I25": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I26": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I27": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I28": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "IMG29": {
      "open": "",
