   {
    "id": "p_00009",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     21,
     7
    ],
    "text": "The [I30]buf[/I30] argument is a pointer to a [B31]stat[/B31] structure, as defined in [A32][I33]&lt;sys/stat.h&gt;[/I33][/A32], into which information is placed concerning the file.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I30": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "B31": {
      "open": "<b>",
      "close": "</b>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "A32": {
      "open": "<a href=\"../basedefs/sys_stat.h.html\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I33": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00010",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     21,
     9
    ],
    "text": "For all other file types defined in this volume of POSIX.1-2024, the structure members [I34]st_mode[/I34], [I35]st_ino[/I35],\n[I36]st_dev[/I36], [I37]st_uid[/I37], [I38]st_gid[/I38], [I39]st_atim[/I39], [I40]st_ctim[/I40], and [I41]st_mtim[/I41] shall have meaningful values and\nthe value of the [I42]st_nlink[/I42] member shall be set to the number of links to the file.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I34": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I35": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I36": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I37": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I38": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I39": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I40": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I41": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I42": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00011",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     21,
     11
    ],
    "text": "An implementation that provides additional or alternative file access control mechanisms may, under implementation-defined\nconditions, cause [I43]fstat[/I43]() to fail.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I43": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00012",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     21,
     13
    ],
    "text": "The [I44]fstat[/I44]() function shall update any time-related fields (as described in XBD [A45][I46]4.12 File Times Update[/I46][/A45]), before writing into the [B47]stat[/B47] structure.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I44": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "A45": {
      "open": "<a href=\"../basedefs/V1_chap04.html#tag_04_12\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I46": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "B47": {
      "open": "<b>",
      "close": "</b>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "h4_00013",
    "type": "h4",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     23
    ],
    "text": "[A48][/A48]RETURN VALUE",
    "placeholders": {
     "A48": {
      "open": "<a name=\"tag_17_189_04\" id=\"tag_17_189_04\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00014",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     25,
     1
    ],
    "text": "Upon successful completion, 0 shall be returned. Otherwise, -1 shall be returned and [I49]errno[/I49] set to indicate the error.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I49": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "h4_00015",
    "type": "h4",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     27
    ],
    "text": "[A50][/A50]ERRORS",
    "placeholders": {
     "A50": {
      "open": "<a name=\"tag_17_189_05\" id=\"tag_17_189_05\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00016",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     29,
     1
    ],
    "text": "The [I51]fstat[/I51]() function shall fail if:",
    "placeholders": {
     "I51": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dt_00017",
    "type": "dt",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     29,
     3,
     3
    ],
    "text": "[EBADF]",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dd_00018",
    "type": "dd",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     29,
     3,
     5
    ],
    "text": "The [I52]fildes[/I52] argument is not a valid file descriptor.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I52": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dt_00019",
    "type": "dt",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     29,
     3,
     7
    ],
    "text": "[EIO]",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dd_00020",
    "type": "dd",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     29,
     3,
     9
    ],
    "text": "An I/O error occurred while reading from the file system.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dt_00021",
    "type": "dt",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     29,
     3,
     11
    ],
    "text": "[EOVERFLOW]",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dd_00022",
    "type": "dd",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     29,
     3,
     13
    ],
    "text": "The file size in bytes or the number of blocks allocated to the file or the file serial number cannot be represented correctly\nin the structure pointed to by [I53]buf[/I53].",
    "placeholders": {
     "I53": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00023",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     29,
     5
    ],
    "text": "The [I54]fstat[/I54]() function may fail if:",
    "placeholders": {
     "I54": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dt_00024",
    "type": "dt",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     29,
     7,
     3
    ],
    "text": "[EOVERFLOW]",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "dd_00025",
    "type": "dd",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     29,
     7,
     5
    ],
    "text": "One of the values is too large to store into the structure pointed to by the [I55]buf[/I55] argument.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I55": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
