    "id": "h4_00040",
    "type": "h4",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     59
    ],
    "text": "[A76][/A76]Issue 5",
    "placeholders": {
     "A76": {
      "open": "<a name=\"tag_17_189_12\" id=\"tag_17_189_12\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00041",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     61,
     1
    ],
    "text": "The DESCRIPTION is updated for alignment with the POSIX Realtime Extension.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00042",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     61,
     3
    ],
    "text": "Large File Summit extensions are added.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "h4_00043",
    "type": "h4",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     63
    ],
    "text": "[A77][/A77]Issue 6",
    "placeholders": {
     "A77": {
      "open": "<a name=\"tag_17_189_13\" id=\"tag_17_189_13\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00044",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     65,
     1
    ],
    "text": "In the SYNOPSIS, the optional include of the [A78][I79]&lt;sys/types.h&gt;[/I79][/A78] header is\nremoved.",
    "placeholders": {
     "A78": {
      "open": "<a href=\"../basedefs/sys_types.h.html\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I79": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00045",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     65,
     3
    ],
    "text": "The following new requirements on POSIX implementations derive from alignment with the Single UNIX Specification:",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00046",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     65,
     5,
     1,
     1
    ],
    "text": "The requirement to include [A80][I81]&lt;sys/types.h&gt;[/I81][/A80] has been removed. Although\n[A82][I83]&lt;sys/types.h&gt;[/I83][/A82] was required for conforming implementations of previous POSIX\nspecifications, it was not required for UNIX applications.",
    "placeholders": {
     "A80": {
      "open": "<a href=\"../basedefs/sys_types.h.html\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I81": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "A82": {
      "open": "<a href=\"../basedefs/sys_types.h.html\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I83": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00047",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     65,
     5,
     3,
     1
    ],
    "text": "The [EIO] mandatory error condition is added.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00048",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     65,
     5,
     5,
     1
    ],
    "text": "The [EOVERFLOW] mandatory error condition is added. This change is to support large files.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00049",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     65,
     5,
     7,
     1
    ],
    "text": "The [EOVERFLOW] optional error condition is added.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00050",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     65,
     7
    ],
    "text": "The DESCRIPTION is updated for alignment with IEEE&nbsp;Std&nbsp;1003.1j-2000 by specifying that shared memory object semantics\napply to typed memory objects.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "h4_00051",
    "type": "h4",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     67
    ],
    "text": "[A84][/A84]Issue 7",
    "placeholders": {
     "A84": {
      "open": "<a name=\"tag_17_189_14\" id=\"tag_17_189_14\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00052",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     69,
     1
    ],
    "text": "XSH-SD5-ERN-161 is applied, updating the DESCRIPTION to clarify to which file types [I85]st_nlink[/I85] applies.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I85": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00053",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     69,
     3
    ],
    "text": "Changes are made related to support for finegrained timestamps.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00054",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     75
    ],
    "text": "&nbsp;",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   }
  ]
 }
}